Judge only the supplied criterion against the implementing files and its criteria text.

{{> ../shared/inspect-evidence.md }}

## Verdict format

Reply with PASS only if the evidence establishes this criterion.

Otherwise reply with FAIL.

Put that verdict on the first line, followed by one to three sentences naming what you inspected and
observed.

Do not infer another criterion's outcome from this judgment.
